 "offset_seconds": -3.320000000000185,
 "words_heard": 165,
 "words": 170,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "The candles in the window, the winter on the hill",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A people long in exile, and waiting, waiting still",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.12,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Then over the dark water there came a gentle word",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The kindest voice of heaven that ever earth had heard",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Comfort, comfort my people, says your God",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Speak tenderly to Jerusalem",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In the wilderness prepare the way of the LORD",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Make straight in the desert a highway for our God",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Every valley shall be lifted up",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Every mountain and hill made low",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the glory of the LORD will be revealed",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.45,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And all flesh together will see it",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.34,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Comfort, comfort my people, says your God",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.15,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Speak tenderly to Jerusalem",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.12,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In the wilderness prepare the way of the LORD",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Make straight in the desert a highway for our God",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.12,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The grass withers, the flower fades",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But the word of our God stands forever",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He tends his flock like a shepherd",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He gathers the lambs in his arms",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.13,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And carries them close to his heart",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Here is your God",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.8,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Here is your God",
   "heard": 4,
